                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A <em>dragon of Damoritosh</em> has two weapon mounts, one in each of the dragon's hands, which can each have any ranged weapon installed or removed with two Interact actions. Any of the dragon's crew or passengers can make Strikes with weapons installed this way. Weapons installed this way that require batteries don't consume any charges when fired, as they can draw power directly from the ship's engine.</p>"
                },
