                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The massive flame cannon built into the dragon of Damoritosh's mouth ignites, dealing @Damage[12d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage to creatures and objects in a @Template[type:cone|distance:40] or an @Template[type:line|distance:80] (@Check[reflex|dc:33|basic] save). This ability can be used by crew or passengers, in addition to the pilot. Fire Breath requires [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds} to cool down before it can be used again.</p>"
