                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The dragon of Damoritosh's intimidating design is magically enhanced to simulate the terrifying presence of an actual dragon. Creatures within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:60], except the crew and passengers, must attempt a @Check[will|dc:32] save. This ability can be used by crew or passengers, in addition to the pilot.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 4}.</p>"
